+**A Gym caveat found while doing this, now fixed.** Directory order used to
+matter. With the live directory read *first*, `fin-saccr-rwa-1790406697`
+came from the live copy, which didn't carry the retained manifest's *mixed*
+mark, so the claim counted that directory's pass: 4 of 10, up to $0.0835.
+The Gym now prefers the retained copy of a run and applies a manifest's
+marks to every copy of that run name, so the directory is left out in
+either order and the claim doesn't count its pass.
 
